AutoMate Taskboard

This product is a modified version of Dashi Taskboard
(https://github.com/chuspeeism/dashi-taskboard), licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0. Copyright for the original work belongs to
its authors and contributors.

Changes made in this version, as required by section 4(b) of the
Apache License 2.0:

- Renamed the application to AutoMate Taskboard, with its own
  application identifier and data directories so it can be installed
  next to Dashi Taskboard.
- Added agent runs: issues can be assigned to Codex or Claude Code,
  started, stopped and steered from the board, with an auto-claim
  scheduler for queued issues.
- Added phone access over Tailscale with device pairing, and a mobile
  board layout.
- Added self-update for Windows builds from a shared folder, with
  ed25519-signed update manifests and the related key generation and
  publishing scripts.
- Added a Traditional Chinese (zh-TW) interface, project folder
  selection, issue import, and Windows process-management changes to
  the launcher and installer.
- Removed upstream release, signing and update-source settings that
  point to the upstream project's accounts; placeholders are used
  instead.

